#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:2
msgid "Extending LMCache: Plugin"
msgstr "扩展 LMCache：插件"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:4
msgid ""
"The LMCache plugin system allows developers to extend functionality by "
"running custom scripts alongside LMCache processes. Plugins can be "
"written in Python and Bash for now, and are managed by the "
"``PluginLauncher`` class."
msgstr "LMCache 插件系统允许开发人员通过在 LMCache 进程旁边运行自定义脚本来扩展功能。目前插件可以用 Python 和 Bash 编写，并由 ``PluginLauncher`` 类管理。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:7
msgid "Key Use Cases"
msgstr "主要用例"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:8
msgid "Start metric reporters for centralized monitoring"
msgstr "启动指标报告器进行集中监控"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:9
msgid "Implement log reporters for log collection systems"
msgstr "实现日志报告器用于日志收集系统"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:10
msgid "Report process-level metrics to alerting systems"
msgstr "向告警系统报告进程级指标"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:11
msgid "Implement health checks and service discovery"
msgstr "实现健康检查和服务发现"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:12
msgid "Custom cache management operations"
msgstr "自定义缓存管理操作"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:15
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:16
msgid ""
"Plugins are configured through environment variables and configuration "
"files:"
msgstr "插件通过环境变量和配置文件进行配置："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:18
msgid ""
"Environment Variables: - ``LMCACHE_PLUGIN_ROLE``: Process role (e.g., "
"``SCHEDULER``, ``WORKER``) - ``LMCACHE_PLUGIN_CONFIG``: JSON string "
"containing plugin configuration - ``LMCACHE_PLUGIN_WORKER_ID``: Current "
"worker ID - ``LMCACHE_PLUGIN_WORKER_COUNT``: Total worker count in "
"cluster"
msgstr "环境变量：- ``LMCACHE_PLUGIN_ROLE``：进程角色（例如 ``SCHEDULER``、``WORKER``）- ``LMCACHE_PLUGIN_CONFIG``：包含插件配置的 JSON 字符串 - ``LMCACHE_PLUGIN_WORKER_ID``：当前工作进程 ID - ``LMCACHE_PLUGIN_WORKER_COUNT``：集群中的工作进程总数"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:24
msgid "Configuration File (``lmcache.yaml``):"
msgstr "配置文件（``lmcache.yaml``）："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:35
msgid "Plugin Naming Convention"
msgstr "插件命名约定"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:36
msgid "Plugin filenames determine execution targets:"
msgstr "插件文件名决定执行目标："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:38
msgid ""
"Role-Specific Plugins: - Format: "
"``<ROLE>[_<WORKER_ID>][_<DESCRIPTION>].<EXTENSION>`` - Examples:"
msgstr "角色特定插件：- 格式：``<ROLE>[_<WORKER_ID>][_<DESCRIPTION>].<EXTENSION>`` - 示例："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:42
msgid "``scheduler_foo_plugin.py``: Runs only on ``SCHEDULER``"
msgstr "``scheduler_foo_plugin.py``：仅在 ``SCHEDULER`` 上运行"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:43
msgid "``worker_0_test.sh``: Runs only on worker ID 0"
msgstr "``worker_0_test.sh``：仅在工作进程 ID 0 上运行"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:44
msgid "``all_plugin.sh``: Runs on all workers"
msgstr "``all_plugin.sh``：在所有工作进程上运行"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:46
msgid ""
"Notes: - Role names are case-insensitive - Worker ID must be numeric when"
" specified - To target a specific worker ID, the filename must have at "
"least three parts separated by underscores (e.g., "
"`worker_<ID>_<DESCRIPTION>.ext`). A file named `worker_<DESCRIPTION>.ext`"
" will run on all workers."
msgstr "注意事项：- 角色名称不区分大小写 - 指定时工作进程 ID 必须是数字 - 要针对特定的工作进程 ID，文件名必须至少有三个部分，用下划线分隔（例如 `worker_<ID>_<DESCRIPTION>.ext`）。名为 `worker_<DESCRIPTION>.ext` 的文件将在所有工作进程上运行。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:52
msgid "Execution Model"
msgstr "执行模型"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Interpreter Detection**: - Uses shebang line (e.g., "
"``#!/opt/venv/bin/python``) - Fallback interpreters:"
msgstr "**解释器检测**：- 使用 shebang 行（例如 ``#!/opt/venv/bin/python``）- 后备解释器："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:57
msgid "``.py`` → ``python``"
msgstr "``.py`` → ``python``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:58
msgid "``.sh`` → ``bash``"
msgstr "``.sh`` → ``bash``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Output Handling**: - Stdout/stderr captured continuously - Logged with "
"plugin name prefix"
msgstr "**输出处理**：- 持续捕获 Stdout/stderr - 使用插件名称前缀记录"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/plugin.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Process Management**: - Launched as subprocesses - Terminated when "
"parent process exits"
msgstr "**进程管理**：- 作为子进程启动 - 当父进程退出时终止"

